HoIkLpwvd6NM4fSUylrRhKiM8HyeaNuQLOb4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7AWrRW4Tvz0wm2CtO5XM2FrkFmQw1HWney58pTo0MNUw&oe=69FDEC81"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "795253620229683", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619159_795253626896349_2733651366559496392_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i8BLolRDwwcQ7kNvwE1FGBW&_nc_oc=AdpIqdlFqsyr8oC9-BweV52dAAOZQ2meeQAD0rqbmF_RSgwy31t0X7SGatBlISvsHJ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7pH8CkrwiTlL2CzbqA0wcUoCIXhb2wCTSGAHK20RYeOQ&oe=69FDDD8F"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "841669665498746", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618093_841669668832079_9141116026824121782_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q_g3BgT97wAQ7kNvwHSqSko&_nc_oc=Adpvrl1n_kTi3n44QMOunp5lFh1GtcFHGI4VKb5nNhj6d7dsGFi-dl5eieO2AA6YVR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6bCRJLJloVsdraz2v59EkL5Ngpg7xfUEZ8sP8aXdcdMg&oe=69FDF1BC"}, {"file_name": "13 (1).png", "id": "1636087437761320", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619450_1636087444427986_186497130864574751_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZXxEoo8p4mYQ7kNvwGDGnau&_nc_oc=AdoKBRRTwcj2pLLPOgRs9wertdc8pztt_SYzMo3zjMODK7_5Jnlv0oR2Sbw7A3T4oIs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Tv4m7gqF4dzvcMml8HaagCpcPY90JtmqXiN6EX02Ofw&oe=69FDCEE1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440_CoverLandscape (3).png", "id": "880993064391941", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618288_880993067725274_615007872304633567_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WUBNJNseUPUQ7kNvwEadKVe&_nc_oc=AdpSoYbEOrkJj638XjovBvPNoZawPt26IRaq_2ySSqBgjR_s8NERVx8xMaDFX9E8bFI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6F9K3OAPp6cDcF7_w1Kmcnk6xNLrU1bck4VFifVoz-6g&oe=69FDE02D"}, "display_name": "Rhythm FAME : Influencer Edition", "keywords": ["Immersive", "Responsive", "Challenging", "Flow", "song"], "long_description": "Rhythm Fame is an **immersive**, **fun**, **engaging**, and **challenging** VR rhythm journey where you become an influencer\u2014your Creator Profile grows as you perform, compete, and chase the spotlight.\n\n* **Influencer progression:** earn **Fame Points**, **level up your Creator Profile**, and watch your status climb after every run.\n{1852707778693177}\n* **Live score competition:** there\u2019s **no static win bar**\u2014you advance by **beating other creators\u2019 scores** while their **progress bars rise in real time**. Track **leaderboard-style** benchmarks like the **Average** and the **World Record**.\n{1508763650421247}\n* **Easy to learn, hard to master:** controls are simple\u2014**LRUD arrows (Left/Right/Up/Down)**\u2014but mastering timing, streaks, and faster patterns takes skill.\n* **VR rhythm gameplay (clear + responsive):** play on **3\u20134 neon lanes** with a central **hit zone**, using your **glowing wand controllers** for tight, **satisfying**, responsive timing.\n{1404922804549817}\n\n* **Flow-state pacing + story replay:** intensity follows the music to keep you \u201cin the zone,\u201d through a connected song story from **college dorm music group** to **world-tour selection**\u2014built for quick sessions, repeat runs, and constant improvement.\n{1218134910275215}", "short_description": "Rhythm Fame is a fun, engaging, challenging and responsive VR rhythm climb where you become an influencer. Hit LRUD (Left/Right/Up/Down) beats on 3\u20134 neon lanes with glowing wand controllers, timing hits in the central zone for Like-bursts. Songs are linked as one story\u2014from dorm band to world-tour tryouts\u2014with flow-state pacing that adapts to track intensity. Earn Fame Points, level up your Creator Profile, and chase Average vs World Record\u2014no static win bar."}]}, "developer_name": "Biswa Games", "developer_privacy_policy_